olutions and go-to-market strategies helps guide DATIA's strategic direction and client engagement approaches."},{"name":"Terry Arsenault","role":"Founder | Ecommerce Brand Builder | Business Intelligence Expert - Vyne","image":"terry-arsenault.png","body":"Terry Arsenault is a seasoned technology leader with over 20 years of experience, specializing in business intelligence and data strategy. Throughout his career, Terry has helped organizations harness the power of data to drive smarter decisions and long-term growth. As the founder of a digital agency and multiple ecommerce brands, he combines deep technical expertise with hands-on entrepreneurial experience. His work spans building scalable Shopify stores, leveraging AI to automate operations, and crafting performance-driven marketing strategies. Today, Terry focuses on helping businesses grow through data, technology, and a sharp understanding of digital commerce."},{"name":"Kathy Hurley","role":"Principal Consultant, Kathy Hurley Consulting LLC","image":"kathy-hurley.jpg","body":"Kathy Hurley is the Principal Consultant at Kathy Hurley Consulting LLC, specializing in strategic marketing and business development. With decades of experience in B2B marketing and consulting, Kathy brings deep expertise in market analysis, competitive positioning, and growth strategies. Her consulting background provides DATIA with valuable perspectives on client needs and market opportunities, helping to shape service offerings and strategic initiatives."},{"name":"Tom Fowler","role":"Sales and Marketing Advisor","image":"tom-fowler.jpg","body":"$f"},{"name":"Jason McKenna","role":"V.P. of Global Educational Strategy, VEX Robotics","image":"jason-mckenna.jpg","body":"Jason McKenna serves as Vice President of Global Educational Strategy at VEX Robotics, where he leads strategic initiatives in educational technology and market development. His expertise in educational markets and technology adoption provides DATIA with valuable insights into the education sector. Jason's experience in scaling educational programs globally and understanding institutional decision-making processes helps inform DATIA's approach to serving educational clients and developing targeted marketing strategies."}]}],false,"$L10"]}],["$L11"],"$L12"]}],"p":"$@13","v":null,"s":"$6"}}]]
